div></li>\n	<li><span class=\"sf-info-steps__num\">2</span><div><strong>Pack your item</strong><p>Place the item in its original packaging with tags attached.</p></div></li>\n	<li><span class=\"sf-info-steps__num\">3</span><div><strong>Hand to courier</strong><p>Our team will arrange a pickup or share a drop-off address.</p></div></li>\n	<li><span class=\"sf-info-steps__num\">4</span><div><strong>Receive your refund</strong><p>Once we verify the item, your refund is processed within 5&ndash;7 business days.</p></div></li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2>What Cannot Be Returned</h2>\n<ul class=\"sf-info-notes\">\n	<li><strong>Custom-sized or custom-made garments</strong> are final sale.</li>\n	<li><strong>Intimates and accessories</strong> (jewelry, scarves) for hygiene reasons.</li>\n	<li><strong>Sale items marked \"Final Sale\"</strong> cannot be returned or exchanged.</li>\n	<li>Items damaged due to misuse, wear, or washing are not eligible.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Exchanges</h2>\n<p>We are happy to exchange for a different size or colour subject to availability. Exchange requests follow the same 7-day window. Please contact our customer care team to begin an exchange.</p>\n\n<h2>Damaged or Wrong Items</h2>\n<p>If your order arrives damaged or you received the wrong item, please contact us within 48 hours of delivery with photos. We will arrange a replacement or full refund at no cost to you.</p>\n', 'Returns & Refunds', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '11-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-04-21 12:22:39', '2026-04-21 12:22:39', '', 11, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/?p=158', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
