(33, 1, '2026-04-01 06:59:44', '2026-04-01 06:59:44', '<p>Drape yourself in understated luxury with this Elegant Organza Saree, woven from feather-light fabric that flows with every step.</p>\n<p>Delicate sheer texture catches the light and lends a soft, ethereal glow perfect for evening soirées.</p>\n<p>Finished with a subtle satin border and matching tassels for that signature designer touch.</p>\n<p>Tailored in Dhaka by skilled artisans who specialise in heritage saree craftsmanship.</p>\n<p>Ideal for weddings, anniversaries, and intimate celebrations where you want to feel quietly extraordinary.</p>\n', 'Elegant Organza Saree', 'Premium organza saree with hand embroidery', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'elegant-organza-saree', '', '', '2026-04-09 06:21:36', '2026-04-09 06:21:36', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/elegant-organza-saree/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(34, 1, '2026-04-01 07:00:06', '2026-04-01 07:00:06', '<p>Bring the freshness of spring into your wardrobe with the Daisy Floral Kurti.</p>\n<p>Hand-printed daisy motifs bloom across breathable cotton, keeping you cool through Dhaka&#039;s warmest afternoons.</p>\n<p>A relaxed straight cut and side slits give you effortless movement from morning errands to evening tea.</p>\n<p>Paired easily with leggings, palazzos or jeans for a fuss-free, feminine look.</p>\n<p>A versatile everyday piece that turns the simplest outfit into something cheerful.</p>\n', 'Daisy Floral Kurti', 'Floral printed cotton kurti', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'daisy-floral-kurti', '', '', '2026-04-09 06:21:36', '2026-04-09 06:21:36', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/daisy-floral-kurti/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(35, 1, '2026-04-01 07:00:10', '2026-04-01 07:00:10', '<p>Step into regal elegance with the Royal Embroidered Kurti, where every stitch tells a story.</p>\n<p>Intricate hand embroidery in gold and ivory threads adorns the neckline and cuffs.</p>\n<p>Crafted from a structured blend that holds its shape beautifully without weighing you down.</p>\n<p>The rich, jewel-toned palette is designed to flatter every skin tone and lighting.</p>\n<p>The perfect statement piece for festive gatherings, family functions and Eid celebrations.</p>\n', 'Royal Embroidered Kurti', 'Hand embroidered cotton-silk kurti', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'royal-embroidered-kurti', '', '', '2026-04-09 06:21:37', '2026-04-09 06:21:37', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/royal-embroidered-kurti/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(36, 1, '2026-04-01 07:00:14', '2026-04-01 07:00:14', '<p>The Teal Handmade Angarkha is a love letter to traditional silhouettes, reimagined for today.</p>\n<p>A flowing front-tie cut sweeps gracefully with each step, accented by hand-stitched detailing along the panels.</p>\n<p>Made from soft, breathable fabric in a deep teal hue that feels both modern and timeless.</p>\n<p>Each piece is hand-finished in our Dhaka atelier, so no two are exactly alike.</p>\n<p>Wear it to art openings, dinner parties, or whenever you want to stand out without trying too hard.</p>\n', 'Teal Handmade Angarkha', 'Handcrafted teal angarkha with embroidery', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'teal-handmade-angarkha', '', '', '2026-04-09 06:21:37', '2026-04-09 06:21:37', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/teal-handmade-angarkha/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(37, 1, '2026-04-01 07:00:18', '2026-04-01 07:00:18', '<p>Step into a meadow with the Floral Garden Salwar Set, blooming with delicate vine prints.</p>\n<p>The lightweight three-piece set includes a kurti, matching salwar and a soft dupatta.</p>\n<p>Breathable fabric and a relaxed silhouette make it perfect for long, busy days.</p>\n<p>Flattering A-line cut skims your figure for a graceful, comfortable fit.</p>\n<p>A fresh, romantic choice for casual lunches, family visits and weekend strolls.</p>\n', 'Floral Garden Salwar Set', 'Floral printed salwar kameez set', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'floral-garden-salwar-set', '', '', '2026-04-22 11:41:53', '2026-04-22 11:41:53', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/floral-garden-salwar-set/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(38, 1, '2026-04-01 07:01:11', '2026-04-01 07:01:11', '<p>The Casual Cotton Kurti is your new go-to for effortless everyday style.</p>\n<p>Woven from 100% pure cotton, it stays soft and breathable wash after wash.</p>\n<p>A minimalist round neckline and three-quarter sleeves offer a timeless silhouette.</p>\n<p>Subtle side slits add ease of movement, ideal for busy mornings and long workdays.</p>\n<p>Dress it up with statement earrings or down with sneakers — it works either way.</p>\n', 'Casual Cotton Kurti', 'Lightweight casual cotton kurti', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'casual-cotton-kurti', '', '', '2026-04-09 06:21:38', '2026-04-09 06:21:38', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/casual-cotton-kurti/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(39, 1, '2026-04-01 07:01:15', '2026-04-01 07:01:15', '<p>Each Handmade Artisan Dress is crafted by hand in small batches by Dhaka&#039;s most talented makers.</p>\n<p>The textured weave and natural dye palette celebrate slow, sustainable fashion.</p>\n<p>A flattering A-line silhouette flows gently over the body for all-day comfort.</p>\n<p>Subtle hand-stitched details along the hem and sleeves make every piece one of a kind.</p>\n<p>A conscious wardrobe choice that supports local craft while looking effortlessly chic.</p>\n', 'Handmade Artisan Dress', 'Unique artisan handmade dress', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'handmade-artisan-dress', '', '', '2026-04-09 06:21:38', '2026-04-09 06:21:38', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/handmade-artisan-dress/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(40, 1, '2026-04-01 07:01:19', '2026-04-01 07:01:19', '<p>The Digital Print Designer Saree brings contemporary art to traditional drape.</p>\n<p>Vivid digitally-printed motifs create a one-of-a-kind canvas you can wear.</p>\n<p>The lightweight fabric drapes beautifully and resists creasing through long events.</p>\n<p>Finished with a contrast border and unstitched blouse piece for full customisation.</p>\n<p>A show-stopping piece for weddings, receptions and milestone celebrations.</p>\n', 'Digital Print Designer Saree', 'Modern digital print crepe saree', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'digital-print-designer-saree', '', '', '2026-04-09 06:21:38', '2026-04-09 06:21:38', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/digital-print-designer-saree/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(41, 1, '2026-04-01 07:01:23', '2026-04-01 07:01:23', '<p>Make every entrance unforgettable with the Glamour Party Collection.</p>\n<p>Shimmering embellishments catch every flash of light, designed to dazzle from across the room.</p>\n<p>A flattering, body-skimming silhouette is sculpted to celebrate your shape.</p>\n<p>Lined with soft fabric for all-night comfort, no matter how long you dance.</p>\n<p>The ultimate statement piece for parties, receptions and night-out celebrations.</p>\n', 'Glamour Party Collection', 'Luxury party wear with sequin work', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'glamour-party-collection', '', '', '2026-04-09 06:21:39', '2026-04-09 06:21:39', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/glamour-party-collection/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(42, 1, '2026-04-01 07:01:27', '2026-04-01 07:01:27', '<p>The Chic Office Wear Kurti is tailored for the woman who means business.</p>\n<p>Clean lines, structured shoulders and a flattering A-line cut command quiet authority.</p>\n<p>Wrinkle-resistant blended fabric keeps you sharp from morning meetings to evening commutes.</p>\n<p>Neutral, sophisticated tones pair effortlessly with formal trousers or pencil skirts.</p>\n<p>Professional, polished and made for the modern Bangladeshi woman in the workplace.</p>\n', 'Chic Office Wear Kurti', 'Professional office wear kurti', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'chic-office-wear-kurti', '', '', '2026-04-09 07:27:55', '2026-04-09 07:27:55', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/chic-office-wear-kurti/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(43, 1, '2026-04-01 07:01:30', '2026-04-01 07:01:30', '<p>Celebrate togetherness with the Family Matching Teal Set, designed for unforgettable family moments.</p>\n<p>Coordinated pieces for mum, dad and the little ones in a calming teal palette.</p>\n<p>Soft, breathable fabric keeps everyone comfortable through long photo shoots and family dinners.</p>\n<p>Subtle gold accents tie each piece together without being matchy-matchy.</p>\n<p>A heartfelt choice for weddings, Eid gatherings and milestone family portraits.</p>\n', 'Family Matching Teal Set', 'Family matching embroidered set', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'family-matching-teal-set', '', '', '2026-04-09 06:21:39', '2026-04-09 06:21:39', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/family-matching-teal-set/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(44, 1, '2026-04-01 07:01:34', '2026-04-01 07:01:34', '<p>The Eid Family Collection captures the joy and warmth of the festive season.</p>\n<p>Luxurious fabrics, intricate embroidery and a rich festive palette make every moment feel special.</p>\n<p>Coordinated outfits for the whole family in flattering, comfortable cuts.</p>\n<p>Designed to photograph beautifully against any backdrop you choose.</p>\n<p>Make this Eid one to remember with matching outfits crafted with love in Dhaka.</p>\n', 'Eid Family Collection', 'Exclusive Eid family matching collection', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'eid-family-collection', '', '', '2026-04-09 06:21:39', '2026-04-09 06:21:39', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/eid-family-collection/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(45, 1, '2026-04-01 07:01:38', '2026-04-01 07:01:38', '<p>The Embroidered Party Luxe is where craftsmanship meets celebration.</p>\n<p>Opulent hand-embroidery sweeps across the bodice in metallic threads and tiny sequins.</p>\n<p>A structured silhouette flatters the figure while still allowing graceful movement.</p>\n<p>Fully lined with breathable inner fabric for hours of effortless wear.</p>\n<p>Designed for weddings, receptions, and the parties you&#039;ll talk about for years.</p>\n', 'Embroidered Party Luxe', 'Gold embroidered luxury party wear', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'embroidered-party-luxe', '', '', '2026-04-22 11:41:53', '2026-04-22 11:41:53', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/embroidered-party-luxe/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(46, 0, '2026-04-01 07:02:25', '2026-04-01 07:02:25', 'Family matching outfits are more than just a trend — they are a beautiful way to celebrate togetherness. From festive occasions to casual outings, coordinated outfits create memorable moments. Here are five creative ways to style your family matching sets from Snazzy Floret.', '5 Ways to Style Your Family Matching Outfits', 'Discover creative ways to style family matching outfits for every occasion.', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '5-ways-to-style-your-family-matching-outfits', '', '', '2026-04-01 07:02:25', '2026-04-01 07:02:25', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/5-ways-to-style-your-family-matching-outfits/', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(47, 0, '2026-04-01 07:02:29', '2026-04-01 07:02:29', 'In a world of fast fashion, handmade clothing stands apart. Each stitch tells a story of craftsmanship, dedication, and artistic vision. At Snazzy Floret, we believe in preserving the art of handmade fashion while embracing modern design sensibilities.', 'The Art of Handmade Fashion: Why It Matters', 'Exploring the beauty and value of handcrafted clothing in modern fashion.', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'the-art-of-handmade-fashion-why-it-matters', '', '', '2026-04-01 07:02:29', '2026-04-01 07:02:29', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/the-art-of-handmade-fashion-why-it-matters/', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(48, 0, '2026-04-01 07:02:31', '2026-04-01 07:02:31', 'Eid is the perfect occasion to showcase your finest fashion choices. This year, we are seeing a beautiful blend of traditional silhouettes with contemporary colors and patterns. From angarkhas to designer sarees, here is your complete Eid fashion guide.', 'Eid Fashion Guide 2026: Top Trends from Dhaka', 'Your complete guide to the hottest Eid fashion trends this season.', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'eid-fashion-guide-2026-top-trends-from-dhaka', '', '', '2026-04-01 07:02:31', '2026-04-01 07:02:31', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/eid-fashion-guide-2026-top-trends-from-dhaka/', 0, 'post', '', 0),
