(52, 1, '2026-04-01 10:02:43', '2026-04-01 10:02:43', '{\n    \"snazzy-floret-theme::sf_hero_slides\": {\n        \"value\": \"[{\\\"image\\\":\\\"http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/03.avif\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"New Collection\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Redefining Everyday\\\",\\\"title_em\\\":\\\"Fashion\\\",\\\"desc\\\":\\\"Step into effortless style with our curated collection of modern essentials\\\",\\\"btn\\\":\\\"Explore Collection\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"\\\"},{\\\"image\\\":\\\"http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/wp-content/themes/snazzy-floret-theme/assets/images/image 28.png\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"Eid Collection\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Family Matching\\\",\\\"title_em\\\":\\\"Outfits\\\",\\\"desc\\\":\\\"Celebrate togetherness with our exclusive family matching collections\\\",\\\"btn\\\":\\\"Explore Collection\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"\\\"},{\\\"image\\\":\\\"http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/wp-content/themes/snazzy-floret-theme/assets/images/image.png\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"Handcrafted\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Elevating Everyday\\\",\\\"title_em\\\":\\\"Style\\\",\\\"desc\\\":\\\"Discover handmade artistry in every thread \\u2014 premium fabrics, timeless designs\\\",\\\"btn\\\":\\\"Explore Collection\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"\\\"}]\",\n        \"type\": \"theme_mod\",\n        \"user_id\": 1,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2026-04-01 10:02:43\"\n    }\n}', '', '', 'trash', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'f476867e-8235-4ea3-a0b4-d495257643c2', '', '', '2026-04-01 10:02:43', '2026-04-01 10:02:43', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/?p=52', 0, 'customize_changeset', '', 0),
(53, 1, '2026-04-01 11:40:22', '2026-04-01 11:40:22', '<p>Regular Wear Style 1 is your everyday essential, reimagined for the modern wardrobe.</p>\n<p>A relaxed silhouette and breathable fabric make it ideal for hot, humid Dhaka days.</p>\n<p>Thoughtful little details — like topstitching and reinforced seams — ensure it lasts.</p>\n<p>Classic neutral tones make it endlessly easy to mix and match.</p>\n<p>The kind of piece you&#039;ll reach for again and again, year after year.</p>\n', 'Terracotta Bloom Kurti', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'regular-wear-style-1', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:04:17', '2026-04-22 08:04:17', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/regular-wear-style-1/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(54, 1, '2026-04-01 11:40:26', '2026-04-01 11:40:26', '<p>Regular Wear Style 2 strikes the perfect balance between comfort and quiet sophistication.</p>\n<p>Soft, naturally breathable fabric drapes effortlessly without clinging.</p>\n<p>A simple round neckline and flattering cut work for almost any body type.</p>\n<p>Versatile enough for school runs, errands or relaxed coffee dates.</p>\n<p>Minimal, modern and built for real life.</p>\n', 'Ivory Grace Salwar Set', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'regular-wear-style-2', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:04:18', '2026-04-22 08:04:18', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/regular-wear-style-2/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(55, 1, '2026-04-01 11:40:30', '2026-04-01 11:40:30', '<p>Regular Wear Style 3 takes everyday dressing to the next level with subtle texture and weave.</p>\n<p>The lightweight fabric feels gentle against the skin all day long.</p>\n<p>Carefully tailored seams give you a polished look without sacrificing comfort.</p>\n<p>Understated colour options pair beautifully with anything in your closet.</p>\n<p>A reliable wardrobe workhorse that always shows up looking effortless.</p>\n', 'Midnight Aura Kameez', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'regular-wear-style-3', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:04:18', '2026-04-22 08:04:18', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/regular-wear-style-3/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(56, 1, '2026-04-01 11:40:34', '2026-04-01 11:40:34', '<p>Regular Wear Style 4 is the kind of dress you wish you&#039;d discovered sooner.</p>\n<p>A gentle A-line cut flatters every figure and feels light all day.</p>\n<p>Made from a high-quality cotton blend that stays soft wash after wash.</p>\n<p>Discreet pockets add a practical, modern twist you&#039;ll appreciate.</p>\n<p>Grab-and-go ease meets understated style — perfect for any day.</p>\n', 'Jasmine Veil Tunic', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'regular-wear-style-4', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:04:18', '2026-04-22 08:04:18', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/regular-wear-style-4/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(57, 1, '2026-04-01 11:40:38', '2026-04-01 11:40:38', '<p>Regular Wear Style 5 puts comfort first without compromising on look.</p>\n<p>Loose, flowy fit lets the fabric move naturally with you.</p>\n<p>Elegant neckline detail elevates an otherwise simple silhouette.</p>\n<p>Ideal for travel, errands or relaxing at home in style.</p>\n<p>Wardrobe ease, quietly elevated.</p>\n', 'Sapphire Muslin Saree', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'regular-wear-style-5', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:04:18', '2026-04-22 08:04:18', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/regular-wear-style-5/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(58, 1, '2026-04-01 11:40:42', '2026-04-01 11:40:42', '<p>Regular Wear Style 6 blends traditional Bangladeshi cuts with a contemporary twist.</p>\n<p>Clean lines and a slightly tapered fit feel fresh yet familiar.</p>\n<p>The soft cotton blend feels almost weightless even in the warmest weather.</p>\n<p>Minimal, refined detailing keeps the look modern and easy to dress up.</p>\n<p>A quiet favourite that earns its place at the front of your wardrobe.</p>\n', 'Rose Quartz Angarkha', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'regular-wear-style-6', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:04:19', '2026-04-22 08:04:19', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/regular-wear-style-6/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(59, 1, '2026-04-01 11:40:47', '2026-04-01 11:40:47', '<p>Regular Wear Style 7 is built for the woman on the move.</p>\n<p>Durable, easy-care fabric handles repeated washes without losing shape.</p>\n<p>A flattering empire waist creates a graceful, feminine silhouette.</p>\n<p>Subtle topstitching adds character without overwhelming the look.</p>\n<p>Reliable, comfortable and quietly stylish — every single day.</p>\n', 'Mulberry Dusk Ensemble', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'regular-wear-style-7', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:04:19', '2026-04-22 08:04:19', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/regular-wear-style-7/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(60, 1, '2026-04-01 11:40:58', '2026-04-01 11:40:58', '<p>Regular Wear Style 8 is a celebration of subtle texture and easy elegance.</p>\n<p>The slubbed weave catches the light and adds visual interest without being loud.</p>\n<p>A forgiving fit moves with you through long days and longer commutes.</p>\n<p>Neutral palette makes it endlessly mixable with what you already own.</p>\n<p>Wear it once and it instantly becomes a wardrobe staple.</p>\n', 'Pearl Whisper Kurti', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'regular-wear-style-8', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:04:19', '2026-04-22 08:04:19', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/regular-wear-style-8/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(61, 1, '2026-04-01 11:41:03', '2026-04-01 11:41:03', '<p>Regular Wear Style 9 brings easy refinement to your everyday lineup.</p>\n<p>A slightly cropped silhouette pairs beautifully with high-waisted bottoms.</p>\n<p>Soft, draping fabric creates flattering movement with every step.</p>\n<p>Built-in stretch ensures comfort from morning to evening.</p>\n<p>A modern classic that punches above its weight.</p>\n', 'Velvet Heritage Kameez', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'regular-wear-style-9', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:04:20', '2026-04-22 08:04:20', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/regular-wear-style-9/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(62, 1, '2026-04-01 11:41:07', '2026-04-01 11:41:07', '<p>Regular Wear Style 10 is a fresh take on the everyday tunic.</p>\n<p>A roomy cut and lightweight fabric keep you cool and comfortable for hours.</p>\n<p>Gentle gathered detail at the yoke adds a feminine, modern touch.</p>\n<p>Breathable enough for the hottest days, sturdy enough for everyday wear.</p>\n<p>A quiet hero in your wardrobe rotation.</p>\n', 'Golden Hour Salwar Suit', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'regular-wear-style-10', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:04:20', '2026-04-22 08:04:20', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/regular-wear-style-10/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(63, 1, '2026-04-01 11:41:11', '2026-04-01 11:41:11', '<p>Regular Wear Style 11 nails laid-back sophistication.</p>\n<p>A loose, easy fit drapes beautifully without ever feeling shapeless.</p>\n<p>The textured weave gives a premium, almost handmade feel.</p>\n<p>Works effortlessly with sandals, sneakers or heels for any occasion.</p>\n<p>The ultimate any-day, anywhere, anything dress.</p>\n', 'Crimson Petal Anarkali', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'regular-wear-style-11', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:04:20', '2026-04-22 08:04:20', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/regular-wear-style-11/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(64, 1, '2026-04-01 11:41:16', '2026-04-01 11:41:16', '<p>Regular Wear Style 12 is designed for women who appreciate quiet luxury.</p>\n<p>Understated detailing and a clean cut speak louder than logos.</p>\n<p>Crafted from premium fabric that drapes like a dream.</p>\n<p>Thoughtful finishing touches make it stand out in person.</p>\n<p>The ideal piece for women who let their style do the talking.</p>\n', 'Silk Breeze Kurti', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'regular-wear-style-12', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:04:21', '2026-04-22 08:04:21', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/regular-wear-style-12/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(65, 1, '2026-04-01 11:41:22', '2026-04-01 11:41:22', '<p>Regular Wear Style 13 channels effortless cool, every single day.</p>\n<p>A relaxed, oversized silhouette feels refreshingly modern.</p>\n<p>Lightweight cotton blend keeps you breezy through Dhaka&#039;s warmest weeks.</p>\n<p>Mix it with heels for a polished look or with sandals for total ease.</p>\n<p>The kind of piece you&#039;ll want in every colour.</p>\n', 'Moonlight Classic Kameez', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'regular-wear-style-13', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:04:22', '2026-04-22 08:04:22', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/regular-wear-style-13/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(66, 1, '2026-04-01 11:41:32', '2026-04-01 11:41:32', '<p>Regular Wear Style 14 is your reliable everyday companion.</p>\n<p>A classic A-line silhouette flatters all body types.</p>\n<p>Reinforced seams and quality stitching mean it&#039;s built to last.</p>\n<p>Gentle on the skin and forgiving to wash and wear.</p>\n<p>Dressed up or down — it works just as beautifully either way.</p>\n', 'Emerald Poise Salwar', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'regular-wear-style-14', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:04:22', '2026-04-22 08:04:22', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/regular-wear-style-14/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(67, 1, '2026-04-01 11:41:37', '2026-04-01 11:41:37', '<p>Regular Wear Style 15 closes out the collection with timeless ease.</p>\n<p>Simple, refined lines and a gentle drape define this everyday hero.</p>\n<p>Made from a soft, breathable blend that feels great against the skin.</p>\n<p>A dependable choice for the woman who values quality and comfort equally.</p>\n<p>The last piece in the lineup — and quite possibly your new favourite.</p>\n', 'Coral Canvas Tunic', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'regular-wear-style-15', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:04:22', '2026-04-22 08:04:22', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/regular-wear-style-15/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
