(151, 0, '2026-04-21 12:15:31', '2026-04-21 12:15:31', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we are</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Our website address is: http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Comments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, and also the visitor&#8217;s IP address and browser user agent string to help spam detection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An anonymized string created from your email address (also called a hash) may be provided to the Gravatar service to see if you are using it. The Gravatar service privacy policy is available here: https://automattic.com/privacy/. After approval of your comment, your profile picture is visible to the public in the context of your comment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Media</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you upload images to the website, you should avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS) included. Visitors to the website can download and extract any location data from images on the website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cookies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment on our site you may opt-in to saving your name, email address and website in cookies. These are for your convenience so that you do not have to fill in your details again when you leave another comment. These cookies will last for one year.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you visit our login page, we will set a temporary cookie to determine if your browser accepts cookies. This cookie contains no personal data and is discarded when you close your browser.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you log in, we will also set up several cookies to save your login information and your screen display choices. Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you select &quot;Remember Me&quot;, your login will persist for two weeks. If you log out of your account, the login cookies will be removed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you edit or publish an article, an additional cookie will be saved in your browser. This cookie includes no personal data and simply indicates the post ID of the article you just edited. It expires after 1 day.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Embedded content from other websites</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we share your data with</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long we retain your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For users that register on our website (if any), we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). Website administrators can also see and edit that information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What rights you have over your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where your data is sent</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n', 'Privacy Policy', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-04-21 12:15:31', '2026-04-21 12:15:31', '', 3, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/?p=151', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(152, 0, '2026-04-21 12:15:41', '2026-04-21 12:15:41', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><b>This is a sample page.</b></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Overview</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our refund and returns policy lasts 30 days. If 30 days have passed since your purchase, we can’t offer you a full refund or exchange.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To be eligible for a return, your item must be unused and in the same condition that you received it. It must also be in the original packaging.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Several types of goods are exempt from being returned. Perishable goods such as food, flowers, newspapers or magazines cannot be returned. We also do not accept products that are intimate or sanitary goods, hazardous materials, or flammable liquids or gases.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Additional non-returnable items:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul>\n<li>Gift cards</li>\n<li>Downloadable software products</li>\n<li>Some health and personal care items</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To complete your return, we require a receipt or proof of purchase.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please do not send your purchase back to the manufacturer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are certain situations where only partial refunds are granted:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul>\n<li>Book with obvious signs of use</li>\n<li>CD, DVD, VHS tape, software, video game, cassette tape, or vinyl record that has been opened.</li>\n<li>Any item not in its original condition, is damaged or missing parts for reasons not due to our error.</li>\n<li>Any item that is returned more than 30 days after delivery</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Refunds</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once your return is received and inspected, we will send you an email to notify you that we have received your returned item. We will also notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you are approved, then your refund will be processed, and a credit will automatically be applied to your credit card or original method of payment, within a certain amount of days.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Late or missing refunds</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you haven’t received a refund yet, first check your bank account again.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Then contact your credit card company, it may take some time before your refund is officially posted.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Next contact your bank. There is often some processing time before a refund is posted.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you’ve done all of this and you still have not received your refund yet, please contact us at {email address}.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sale items</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Only regular priced items may be refunded. Sale items cannot be refunded.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Exchanges</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We only replace items if they are defective or damaged. If you need to exchange it for the same item, send us an email at {email address} and send your item to: {physical address}.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gifts</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If the item was marked as a gift when purchased and shipped directly to you, you’ll receive a gift credit for the value of your return. Once the returned item is received, a gift certificate will be mailed to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If the item wasn’t marked as a gift when purchased, or the gift giver had the order shipped to themselves to give to you later, we will send a refund to the gift giver and they will find out about your return.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Shipping returns</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To return your product, you should mail your product to: {physical address}.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You will be responsible for paying for your own shipping costs for returning your item. Shipping costs are non-refundable. If you receive a refund, the cost of return shipping will be deducted from your refund.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Depending on where you live, the time it may take for your exchanged product to reach you may vary.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you are returning more expensive items, you may consider using a trackable shipping service or purchasing shipping insurance. We don’t guarantee that we will receive your returned item.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Need help?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact us at {email} for questions related to refunds and returns.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Returns & Refunds', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '11-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-04-21 12:15:41', '2026-04-21 12:15:41', '', 11, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/?p=152', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(153, 0, '2026-04-21 12:15:52', '2026-04-21 12:15:52', '<div class=\"sf-faq-groups\">\n	<section class=\"sf-faq-group\">\n		<div class=\"sf-faq-group__head\">\n			<span class=\"sf-faq-group__badge\">01</span>\n			<h2>Orders &amp; Payment</h2>\n		</div>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>How do I place an order?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Browse our collections, add items to your cart, and proceed to checkout. You can order as a guest or create an account for faster future checkouts and order tracking.</p></div></details>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>What payment methods do you accept?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>We accept bKash, Nagad, Rocket, cash on delivery, and major bank cards. All digital payments are secured with SSL encryption.</p></div></details>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>Can I change or cancel my order?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Orders can be changed or cancelled within 2 hours of placement. Please call us at <strong>01621-008533</strong> as soon as possible.</p></div></details>\n	</section>\n\n	<section class=\"sf-faq-group\">\n		<div class=\"sf-faq-group__head\">\n			<span class=\"sf-faq-group__badge\">02</span>\n			<h2>Shipping &amp; Delivery</h2>\n		</div>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>How long does delivery take?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Orders inside Dhaka are delivered within 1&ndash;3 business days. Outside Dhaka takes 3&ndash;5 business days.</p></div></details>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>How can I track my order?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Log in to your account and visit the Orders section, or use the tracking link sent to your phone and email after shipping.</p></div></details>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>Do you ship outside Bangladesh?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Currently we ship nationwide within Bangladesh. International shipping can be arranged on request &mdash; please contact us directly.</p></div></details>\n	</section>\n\n	<section class=\"sf-faq-group\">\n		<div class=\"sf-faq-group__head\">\n			<span class=\"sf-faq-group__badge\">03</span>\n			<h2>Sizing &amp; Customization</h2>\n		</div>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>Do you offer custom sizing?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Yes. Most of our collections support custom sizing. After placing your order, contact us with your measurements and we will tailor your piece to fit.</p></div></details>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>How do I find my correct size?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Every product page includes a detailed size chart. If you are between sizes, we recommend sizing up or reaching out for personalised guidance.</p></div></details>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>Can I order matching family sets with different sizes?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Absolutely. Family matching is our specialty &mdash; just select the appropriate sizes for each person when ordering.</p></div></details>\n	</section>\n\n	<section class=\"sf-faq-group\">\n		<div class=\"sf-faq-group__head\">\n			<span class=\"sf-faq-group__badge\">04</span>\n			<h2>Returns &amp; Care</h2>\n		</div>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>We accept returns within 7 days of delivery for unworn items in original condition. Custom-sized pieces are non-returnable. See our <a href=\"/returns-refunds/\">Returns &amp; Refunds</a> page for full details.</p></div></details>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>How should I care for my garment?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>We recommend gentle hand wash or dry cleaning for silk and georgette. Cotton pieces can be machine washed on a cold, gentle cycle. Always refer to the care label.</p></div></details>\n	</section>\n</div>\n', 'FAQ', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'faq', '', '', '2026-04-21 12:22:39', '2026-04-21 12:22:39', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/faq/', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(154, 0, '2026-04-21 12:15:57', '2026-04-21 12:15:57', '<div class=\"sf-info-grid sf-info-grid--3\">\n	<div class=\"sf-info-tile\">\n		<div class=\"sf-info-tile__icon\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"13\"/><polygon points=\"16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8\"/><circle cx=\"5.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg></div>\n		<h3>Inside Dhaka</h3>\n		<p class=\"sf-info-tile__lead\">৳70 &middot; 1&ndash;3 business days</p>\n		<p>Same-day dispatch for orders placed before 3pm.</p>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"sf-info-tile\">\n		<div class=\"sf-info-tile__icon\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"12\"/><path d=\"M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z\"/></svg></div>\n		<h3>Outside Dhaka</h3>\n		<p class=\"sf-info-tile__lead\">৳130 &middot; 3&ndash;5 business days</p>\n		<p>All 64 districts covered through trusted courier partners.</p>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"sf-info-tile sf-info-tile--highlight\">\n		<div class=\"sf-info-tile__icon\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"/></svg></div>\n		<h3>Free Shipping</h3>\n		<p class=\"sf-info-tile__lead\">On orders above ৳3,000</p>\n		<p>Applied automatically at checkout &mdash; anywhere in Bangladesh.</p>\n	</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>How We Ship</h2>\n<ol class=\"sf-info-steps\">\n	<li><span class=\"sf-info-steps__num\">1</span><div><strong>Order Placed</strong><p>You receive a confirmation via SMS and email within minutes.</p></div></li>\n	<li><span class=\"sf-info-steps__num\">2</span><div><strong>Packed with Care</strong><p>Each piece is inspected, folded with tissue, and sealed in our branded packaging.</p></div></li>\n	<li><span class=\"sf-info-steps__num\">3</span><div><strong>Dispatched</strong><p>Orders are handed to our courier partner within 24 hours of confirmation.</p></div></li>\n	<li><span class=\"sf-info-steps__num\">4</span><div><strong>Delivered</strong><p>You receive a tracking link to follow your order all the way to your door.</p></div></li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2>Important Notes</h2>\n<ul class=\"sf-info-notes\">\n	<li>Delivery times may extend slightly during public holidays and festive seasons.</li>\n	<li>Please ensure the phone number provided at checkout is active &mdash; our courier will call before delivery.</li>\n	<li>For urgent deliveries, please contact us at <strong>01621-008533</strong> before placing your order.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'Shipping', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'shipping', '', '', '2026-04-21 12:22:39', '2026-04-21 12:22:39', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/shipping/', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(155, 0, '2026-04-21 12:19:41', '2026-04-21 12:19:41', '', 'Contact', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'contact', '', '', '2026-04-21 12:19:41', '2026-04-21 12:19:41', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/contact/', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(156, 0, '2026-04-21 12:22:39', '2026-04-21 12:22:39', '<div class=\"sf-faq-groups\">\n	<section class=\"sf-faq-group\">\n		<div class=\"sf-faq-group__head\">\n			<span class=\"sf-faq-group__badge\">01</span>\n			<h2>Orders &amp; Payment</h2>\n		</div>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>How do I place an order?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Browse our collections, add items to your cart, and proceed to checkout. You can order as a guest or create an account for faster future checkouts and order tracking.</p></div></details>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>What payment methods do you accept?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>We accept bKash, Nagad, Rocket, cash on delivery, and major bank cards. All digital payments are secured with SSL encryption.</p></div></details>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>Can I change or cancel my order?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Orders can be changed or cancelled within 2 hours of placement. Please call us at <strong>01621-008533</strong> as soon as possible.</p></div></details>\n	</section>\n\n	<section class=\"sf-faq-group\">\n		<div class=\"sf-faq-group__head\">\n			<span class=\"sf-faq-group__badge\">02</span>\n			<h2>Shipping &amp; Delivery</h2>\n		</div>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>How long does delivery take?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Orders inside Dhaka are delivered within 1&ndash;3 business days. Outside Dhaka takes 3&ndash;5 business days.</p></div></details>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>How can I track my order?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Log in to your account and visit the Orders section, or use the tracking link sent to your phone and email after shipping.</p></div></details>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>Do you ship outside Bangladesh?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Currently we ship nationwide within Bangladesh. International shipping can be arranged on request &mdash; please contact us directly.</p></div></details>\n	</section>\n\n	<section class=\"sf-faq-group\">\n		<div class=\"sf-faq-group__head\">\n			<span class=\"sf-faq-group__badge\">03</span>\n			<h2>Sizing &amp; Customization</h2>\n		</div>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>Do you offer custom sizing?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Yes. Most of our collections support custom sizing. After placing your order, contact us with your measurements and we will tailor your piece to fit.</p></div></details>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>How do I find my correct size?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Every product page includes a detailed size chart. If you are between sizes, we recommend sizing up or reaching out for personalised guidance.</p></div></details>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>Can I order matching family sets with different sizes?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>Absolutely. Family matching is our specialty &mdash; just select the appropriate sizes for each person when ordering.</p></div></details>\n	</section>\n\n	<section class=\"sf-faq-group\">\n		<div class=\"sf-faq-group__head\">\n			<span class=\"sf-faq-group__badge\">04</span>\n			<h2>Returns &amp; Care</h2>\n		</div>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>We accept returns within 7 days of delivery for unworn items in original condition. Custom-sized pieces are non-returnable. See our <a href=\"/returns-refunds/\">Returns &amp; Refunds</a> page for full details.</p></div></details>\n		<details class=\"sf-faq-q\"><summary>How should I care for my garment?</summary><div class=\"sf-faq-a\"><p>We recommend gentle hand wash or dry cleaning for silk and georgette. Cotton pieces can be machine washed on a cold, gentle cycle. Always refer to the care label.</p></div></details>\n	</section>\n</div>\n', 'FAQ', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '153-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-04-21 12:22:39', '2026-04-21 12:22:39', '', 153, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/?p=156', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(157, 0, '2026-04-21 12:22:39', '2026-04-21 12:22:39', '<div class=\"sf-info-grid sf-info-grid--3\">\n	<div class=\"sf-info-tile\">\n		<div class=\"sf-info-tile__icon\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"13\"/><polygon points=\"16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8\"/><circle cx=\"5.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg></div>\n		<h3>Inside Dhaka</h3>\n		<p class=\"sf-info-tile__lead\">৳70 &middot; 1&ndash;3 business days</p>\n		<p>Same-day dispatch for orders placed before 3pm.</p>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"sf-info-tile\">\n		<div class=\"sf-info-tile__icon\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"12\"/><path d=\"M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z\"/></svg></div>\n		<h3>Outside Dhaka</h3>\n		<p class=\"sf-info-tile__lead\">৳130 &middot; 3&ndash;5 business days</p>\n		<p>All 64 districts covered through trusted courier partners.</p>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"sf-info-tile sf-info-tile--highlight\">\n		<div class=\"sf-info-tile__icon\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"/></svg></div>\n		<h3>Free Shipping</h3>\n		<p class=\"sf-info-tile__lead\">On orders above ৳3,000</p>\n		<p>Applied automatically at checkout &mdash; anywhere in Bangladesh.</p>\n	</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>How We Ship</h2>\n<ol class=\"sf-info-steps\">\n	<li><span class=\"sf-info-steps__num\">1</span><div><strong>Order Placed</strong><p>You receive a confirmation via SMS and email within minutes.</p></div></li>\n	<li><span class=\"sf-info-steps__num\">2</span><div><strong>Packed with Care</strong><p>Each piece is inspected, folded with tissue, and sealed in our branded packaging.</p></div></li>\n	<li><span class=\"sf-info-steps__num\">3</span><div><strong>Dispatched</strong><p>Orders are handed to our courier partner within 24 hours of confirmation.</p></div></li>\n	<li><span class=\"sf-info-steps__num\">4</span><div><strong>Delivered</strong><p>You receive a tracking link to follow your order all the way to your door.</p></div></li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2>Important Notes</h2>\n<ul class=\"sf-info-notes\">\n	<li>Delivery times may extend slightly during public holidays and festive seasons.</li>\n	<li>Please ensure the phone number provided at checkout is active &mdash; our courier will call before delivery.</li>\n	<li>For urgent deliveries, please contact us at <strong>01621-008533</strong> before placing your order.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'Shipping', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '154-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-04-21 12:22:39', '2026-04-21 12:22:39', '', 154, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/?p=157', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(160, 0, '2026-04-21 12:36:31', '2026-04-21 12:36:31', '', 'About us', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'about', '', '', '2026-04-21 12:36:31', '2026-04-21 12:36:31', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/about/', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(161, 0, '2026-04-22 08:11:33', '2026-04-22 08:11:33', '<p>There\'s a quiet magic to a family that walks in together dressed in coordinated tones — not costume-matching, but <em>coordinated</em>. In Dhaka, where weddings, Eid gatherings, and holiday shoots are woven into the fabric of family life, getting this right matters.</p>\n\n<h2>Start with a shared palette, not identical prints</h2>\n<p>The most common mistake families make is picking the same print for every member. It photographs flat and feels costumey. Instead, pick two or three tones — say, cream, soft rose, and olive — and let each family member wear one dominant tone with accents of the others. The result reads as intentional, not matching.</p>\n\n<h2>Anchor with the mother\'s outfit</h2>\n<p>The mother\'s saree or salwar is usually the most detailed piece. Build outwards from her palette. Daughters can pick up one colour from her pallu. Fathers and sons can nod to it through a pocket square, dupatta, or panjabi trim.</p>\n\n<h2>Vary texture, keep tone</h2>\n<p>If everyone is in the same tone and same fabric, the group reads as a uniform. Mix cotton, silk, and linen within the same palette — the photos will have depth without breaking the harmony.</p>\n\n<p>If you\'re planning a matching look for the family, our <a href=\"/shop/\">Family Matching collection</a> is built exactly for this kind of thoughtful coordination.</p>', 'The Art of Family Matching: A Dhaka Guide to Coordinated Looks', 'Family matching is having a real moment — here\'s how to do it with elegance, not costume.', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'art-of-family-matching', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:11:33', '2026-04-22 08:11:33', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/art-of-family-matching/', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(180, 0, '2026-04-22 08:49:14', '2026-04-22 08:49:14', '', 'cover-banner', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'cover-banner', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:49:14', '2026-04-22 08:49:14', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/cover-banner/', 0, 'attachment', 'image/png', 0),
(163, 0, '2026-04-22 08:11:34', '2026-04-22 08:11:34', '<p>Ask anyone who has spent a Dhaka summer in the wrong fabric and you\'ll hear the same refrain: the outfit looked beautiful on the hanger and unbearable by noon. The secret to summer dressing isn\'t the cut — it\'s the weave.</p>\n\n<h2>Why muslin is Bangladesh\'s summer heritage</h2>\n<p>Muslin is a native legacy. At its finest, it\'s so light the fabric feels like breath. Contemporary muslin is more robust than its historic counterpart but still retains the airiness that makes it ideal for 36°C afternoons. Look for a close, even weave and a slight natural sheen.</p>\n\n<h2>Cotton: the everyday workhorse</h2>\n<p>Pure cotton, especially with a looser weave, is a summer staple for good reason. It breathes, absorbs moisture, and forgives movement. For office wear or travel, cotton kurtis in light palette hold their shape better than synthetic blends and don\'t cling when the humidity climbs.</p>\n\n<h2>What to avoid</h2>\n<p>Polyester, even when marketed as \"cool\", traps heat against the body. Heavy silk is beautiful for evening events but unwise for daytime heat. If in doubt, hold the fabric to light — if it\'s slightly translucent and feels cool in the hand, it\'ll treat you well.</p>', 'Fabric Spotlight: Why Muslin and Cotton Reign Supreme in Summer', 'Dhaka summers aren\'t forgiving. The right fabric decides whether your outfit carries you through the day — or against it.', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'muslin-cotton-summer', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:11:34', '2026-04-22 08:11:34', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/muslin-cotton-summer/', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(164, 0, '2026-04-22 08:11:34', '2026-04-22 08:11:34', '', '7', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', '7', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:11:34', '2026-04-22 08:11:34', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/7/', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(165, 0, '2026-04-22 08:11:35', '2026-04-22 08:11:35', '<p>The best Eid outfit isn\'t the one that looked stunning on the day — it\'s the one you found yourself reaching for three months later at a cousin\'s dinner. When you\'re building a family matching look for Eid 2026, think longevity.</p>\n\n<h2>Pick a base palette that works beyond Eid</h2>\n<p>Ivory, sage, dusty rose, terracotta — these colours anchor the outfit in the festive mood of Eid but don\'t limit it to just that occasion. Bright festival-only colours (neon pink, electric blue) photograph well once, then sit in the wardrobe.</p>\n\n<h2>Invest in one \"signature\" piece per person</h2>\n<p>Instead of buying a complete new outfit for each family member, choose one standout piece each — a hand-embroidered kurti for mum, a panjabi with considered details for dad, a matching dupatta for daughter. Build the rest of the outfit from wardrobe staples.</p>\n\n<h2>Plan the tailoring six weeks out</h2>\n<p>Every Eid, tailors in Dhaka get buried in last-minute work. Custom-tailored family sets need at least six weeks to be done well. Start in early Ramadan, not the week before.</p>\n\n<p>We\'re already taking Eid 2026 orders — <a href=\"/shop/\">browse the family collection</a> and reach out early.</p>', 'Eid 2026: Building a Family Matching Look That Lasts', 'Beyond the first Eid photo — how to choose pieces the family will actually wear again.', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'eid-2026-family-matching', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:11:35', '2026-04-22 08:11:35', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/eid-2026-family-matching/', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(166, 0, '2026-04-22 08:11:35', '2026-04-22 08:11:35', '', '14', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', '14', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:11:35', '2026-04-22 08:11:35', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/14/', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(167, 0, '2026-04-22 08:11:36', '2026-04-22 08:11:36', '<p>Most fit issues with custom clothing don\'t come from bad tailoring — they come from inconsistent measurements. Here\'s a clean way to share yours and never deal with a second round of alterations.</p>\n\n<h2>Use a soft tape, not a wooden ruler</h2>\n<p>A soft, cloth measuring tape is standard. Plastic retractable tapes can be too tight or slip. If you don\'t have one, a piece of string followed by measuring against a ruler works — it\'s how our grandmothers did it.</p>\n\n<h2>Wear a fitted top, not the clothes you\'ll wear over it</h2>\n<p>Measure over a light, close-fitting layer. Not a baggy t-shirt, not bare skin (which drifts). Stand straight, arms relaxed, weight on both feet evenly.</p>\n\n<h2>The three measurements that matter most</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bust:</strong> widest part, tape level across the back</li>\n<li><strong>Waist:</strong> the natural indent above the hip, not the lower belt line</li>\n<li><strong>Hip:</strong> widest part, usually around the seat</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For kurtis and kameez, we\'ll also ask for shoulder, arm length, and kameez length. Send everything in centimetres if you can — it\'s more precise than inches.</p>\n\n<h2>Tell us your fit preference</h2>\n<p>Measurements alone don\'t convey whether you like things snug or relaxed. A one-line note — \"I prefer a loose fit through the waist\" — helps more than an extra measurement.</p>', 'Custom Tailoring 101: How to Share Your Measurements', 'A short, practical guide to getting measurements right the first time — no guesswork, no returns.', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'custom-tailoring-measurements', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:11:36', '2026-04-22 08:11:36', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/custom-tailoring-measurements/', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(168, 0, '2026-04-22 08:11:36', '2026-04-22 08:11:36', '', '21', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', '21', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:11:36', '2026-04-22 08:11:36', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/21/', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(169, 0, '2026-04-22 08:11:37', '2026-04-22 08:11:37', '<p>Mother-daughter dressing lives in a delicate space. Too matchy and it reads as a uniform. Too different and the \"pair\" quality is lost. These five pairings balance both sides cleanly.</p>\n\n<h2>1. Ivory saree + soft-peach salwar kameez</h2>\n<p>A timeless combination that works at weddings, Eids, and portrait sessions. Ivory reads elegant on the mother; the peach adds softness on the daughter without competing.</p>\n\n<h2>2. Deep-teal angarkha + teal-and-gold kurti</h2>\n<p>Same palette, different silhouettes. The angarkha\'s length on the mother and the kurti\'s clean lines on the daughter photograph beautifully together.</p>\n\n<h2>3. Block-printed kurti sets in matching palette, different prints</h2>\n<p>For casual family events or travel. Pick two kurtis from the same block-print family — the prints differ, but the colour palette ties them.</p>\n\n<h2>4. White salwar + ice-blue dress</h2>\n<p>Modern and minimal. The mother in white, the daughter in a soft pastel from the same cool-tone family. Add matching pearl or silver jewellery to tie the look.</p>\n\n<h2>5. Terracotta saree + mustard kurti</h2>\n<p>Warm tones for autumn shoots or Eid-ul-Azha. Rich, earthy, and photographs with incredible warmth against neutral backgrounds.</p>', '5 Timeless Mother-Daughter Outfit Ideas', 'Five mother-daughter pairings that feel considered, not matchy — good for weddings, Eid, and family portraits alike.', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'mother-daughter-outfit-ideas', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:11:37', '2026-04-22 08:11:37', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/mother-daughter-outfit-ideas/', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(177, 0, '2026-04-22 08:45:36', '2026-04-22 08:45:36', '', 'family-matching-set-1', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'family-matching-set-1', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:45:36', '2026-04-22 08:45:36', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/family-matching-set-1/', 0, 'attachment', 'image/png', 0),
(171, 0, '2026-04-22 08:11:38', '2026-04-22 08:11:38', '<p>Snazzy Floret didn\'t start as a business plan. It started as a single mother-daughter matching set, stitched in a small studio in Dhaka, for a family wedding.</p>\n\n<h2>The idea that wouldn\'t go away</h2>\n<p>The compliments that afternoon weren\'t unusual — but the questions were. Where did you get it? Can I order one? Can you do a Panjabi for my son to match? That was the first spark.</p>\n\n<h2>Building a first collection</h2>\n<p>The first collection was modest — twelve pieces, four fabrics, one clear idea: make matching family wear that doesn\'t feel like a costume. We chose fabrics that breathe, cuts that sit well on real bodies, and a palette of warm neutrals that work for weddings, Eid, and everyday.</p>\n\n<h2>What we learned along the way</h2>\n<p>The first few months taught us that custom sizing matters more than trend-chasing, that packaging is part of the gift, and that the customer who comes back for a second order is the one who tells all their friends. Those lessons still drive every choice we make today.</p>\n\n<p>Eighty-two thousand followers later, we\'re still that small studio — just with more hands. Thank you for being part of it.</p>', 'The Story Behind Snazzy Floret\'s First Collection', 'How a small studio in Dhaka turned a family idea into a brand — and what we learned along the way.', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'snazzy-floret-first-collection', '', '', '2026-04-22 08:11:38', '2026-04-22 08:11:38', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/snazzy-floret-first-collection/', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(184, 0, '2026-04-22 10:26:45', '2026-04-22 10:26:45', 'A handwoven Jamdani kurti crafted in the age-old weaving tradition of Bengal. Each motif is worked into the fabric on the loom, not printed — which is why no two pieces are ever exactly alike. Made with soft, breathable muslin that wears beautifully through Dhaka summers.', 'Handwoven Jamdani Kurti', 'Traditional Jamdani weaving on breathable muslin — each piece takes weeks to complete.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'handwoven-jamdani-kurti', '', '', '2026-04-22 10:53:20', '2026-04-22 10:53:20', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/handwoven-jamdani-kurti/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
