(186, 0, '2026-04-22 10:26:48', '2026-04-22 10:26:48', 'Hand-carved wooden blocks press each motif onto soft cotton, one at a time. Slight variation in the print is the mark of its authenticity. Cut as an angarkha with a cross-over front and gathered skirt — a silhouette that flatters every figure.', 'Block-Printed Cotton Angarkha', 'Hand-block printed in small batches, finished with cotton thread tassels.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'block-printed-cotton-angarkha', '', '', '2026-04-22 10:53:20', '2026-04-22 10:53:20', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/block-printed-cotton-angarkha/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
