(188, 0, '2026-04-22 10:26:51', '2026-04-22 10:26:51', 'Fine silk panjabi with chain-stitch embroidery along the placket and cuffs, worked entirely by hand. The silk is sourced from Rajshahi and the stitching takes about two weeks per piece. An heirloom Eid or wedding choice.', 'Embroidered Silk Panjabi', 'Hand-embroidered silk panjabi finished with a traditional placket.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'embroidered-silk-panjabi', '', '', '2026-04-22 10:53:20', '2026-04-22 10:53:20', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/embroidered-silk-panjabi/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
