(190, 0, '2026-04-22 10:26:53', '2026-04-22 10:26:53', 'A quietly modern kameez in pure Bangladeshi linen. All finishing — seams, hem, neckline binding — is done by hand, which gives the piece an unmistakably soft drape that machine finishing can\'t replicate. Pairs with any salwar.', 'Hand-Stitched Linen Kameez', 'Pure linen kameez, finished seams and hem stitched entirely by hand.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'hand-stitched-linen-kameez', '', '', '2026-04-22 10:53:20', '2026-04-22 10:53:20', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/hand-stitched-linen-kameez/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
