(192, 0, '2026-04-22 10:26:56', '2026-04-22 10:26:56', 'Hand-applied mirror-work (shisha) across the yoke and sleeves, worked with cotton thread in warm brand tones. Heavy enough to feel luxurious, light enough to wear to a dinner or festival. Finished with hidden side slits for comfortable movement.', 'Mirror-Work Festive Kurti', 'Traditional mirror-work embroidery on deep-tone cotton — a festive statement.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'mirror-work-festive-kurti', '', '', '2026-04-22 10:53:20', '2026-04-22 10:53:20', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/mirror-work-festive-kurti/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
