(194, 0, '2026-04-22 10:26:58', '2026-04-22 10:26:58', 'Pure handwoven Tussar silk saree, naturally golden in tone. The pallu carries a contrasting woven border and small motif work. Soft enough for daily draping, dressy enough for a wedding. Comes with an unstitched blouse piece in matching tone.', 'Tussar Silk Saree — Handwoven', 'Handwoven Tussar silk saree with a natural gold sheen and contrasting pallu.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'tussar-silk-saree-handwoven', '', '', '2026-04-22 10:53:20', '2026-04-22 10:53:20', '', 0, 'http://localhost/sklentr/snazzy-floret/product/tussar-silk-saree-handwoven/', 0, 'product', '', 0),
